  "rawText": "Item Class: One Hand Swords\nRarity: Rare\nYou cannot use this item. Its stats will be ignored\n--------\nHavoc Bite\nJewelled Foil\n--------\nOne Hand Sword\nPhysical Damage: 61-110 (augmented)\nElemental Damage: 10-20 (augmented), 3-45 (augmented)\nCritical Strike Chance: 5.50%\nAttacks per Second: 1.60\nWeapon Range: 1.1 metres\n--------\nRequirements:\nLevel: 68\nDex: 212\n--------\nSockets: R-G-B \n--------\nItem Level: 84\n--------\nAllocates Ruthless (enchant)\n--------\n{ Implicit Modifier — Damage, Critical }\n+25% to Global Critical Strike Multiplier\n--------\n{ Prefix Modifier \"Tyrannical\" (Tier: 2) — Damage, Physical, Attack }\n155(155-169)% increased Physical Damage\n{ Prefix Modifier \"Smoldering\" (Tier: 6) — Damage, Elemental, Fire, Attack }\nAdds 10(9-12) to 20(19-22) Fire Damage\n{ Prefix Modifier \"Shocking\" (Tier: 4) — Damage, Elemental, Lightning, Attack }\nAdds 3(2-5) to 45(41-47) Lightning Damage\n{ Suffix Modifier \"of Venom\" (Tier: 1) — Damage, Chaos, Ailment }\n20(16-20)% chance to Poison on Hit\n{ Master Crafted Suffix Modifier \"of Craft\" (Rank: 2) — Attack, Speed }\n12(10-12)% increased Attack Speed\n{ Unique Modifier }\nCast Level 20 Fire Burst on Hit\n",
